[
  {
    "beat_id": 1,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "陆先生。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九是被木鱼声吵醒的。\n不是算卦山钟。是一阵木鱼声。极慢。一息一下。从算卦山山脚的天机阁临安分舵传上来。\n陆九睁开眼——两只眼都看不见。他躺在白树根上。肚脐的绿"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 2,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "馒头的孩子——瞎眼先生留。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "老阁主走到陆九左边。左手边。放了一样东西到陆九左手心。\n是一块木牌。巴掌大。表面是旧的。\n陆九的左手在木牌上摸。\n一面刻着字：\"馒头的孩子——瞎眼先生留。\"\n另"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 3,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "三十年前。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的左手停了。\n\"三十年前。\" 老阁主说，\"陆先生六岁。在临安城南门的算卦摊上。\"\n\"我不记得。\"\n\"陆先生不记得。但白无垢的母亲记得。\" 老阁主说，\"白小妹"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 4,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "白无垢——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的右手按在肚脐上。\n\"白无垢——\" 陆九的声音变了，\"白无垢的右手——是白无垢自己挖掉双眼炼进去的。\"\n\"是。\"\n\"为什么？\"\n\"因为白无垢恨瞎眼先生。\" "
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 5,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "白无垢不是想杀我。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的左手在木牌上松了。木牌掉在地上。\n\"白无垢不是想杀我。\" 陆九说。\n\"白无垢想被陆先生认出。\" 老阁主说，\"白无垢想陆先生记起——那个馒头的孩子。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 6,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我六岁那年的左眼已经瞎了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的右手从肚脐上挪开，用右手摸自己的左眼。\n\"我六岁那年的左眼已经瞎了。\" 陆九说。\n\"是。\"\n\"南门城墙下的冬天是临安城最冷的地方。\" 陆九说，\"那个女乞丐"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 7,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "白小妹就是白无垢的母亲。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "老阁主没说话。\n\"白小妹就是白无垢的母亲。\"\n\"是。\"\n\"白无垢——是我——那个孩子的儿子。\"\n\"是。\"\n\"我——是白无垢的——\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 8,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "陆先生。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九没说完。\n老阁主站住了。\n老阁主的布鞋从白树根上挪开。老阁主转身往山下走。\n走的方向——是分舵。\n老阁主去见白无垢了。\n老阁主的脚步声极慢。从山顶往山下去。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 9,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "那个瞎眼先生——是这世上唯一一个没笑我的人",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的左手按在肚脐上。陆九的左眼——红的——流泪了。\n陆九的左手从肚脐上挪开，伸出去了。\n陆九的左手碰到白无垢的右手——新的那只白骨的。\n白无垢的右手指节咯吱咯"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 10,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "白小妹——是我给的那个馒头的孩子。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的左手在白无垢的右手上停了。\n停了五息。\n陆九的左手挪开。\n陆九的嘴说了第一句话：\n\"白小妹——是我给的那个馒头的孩子。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 11,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我母亲说的那个瞎眼先生——就是你？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白无垢——没笑出来。\n白无垢的木屐——在地上——不点了。\n白无垢的嘴也张了。\n白无垢的嘴说了一句话：\n\"我母亲说的那个瞎眼先生——就是你？\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 12,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "无垢——你找到瞎眼先生了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的左手又伸出去了。\n陆九的左手又碰到白无垢的右手。\n摸的那一刹那——\n白无垢的右手——从手腕到手指尖——整只白骨手——裂成了十二片白骨。\n十二片白骨——不是"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 13,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "白无垢——我认你。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白无垢——第一次——笑了。\n白无垢的笑——不是平时的笑。是白小妹的笑。\n白无垢的两只眼——在笑里——都裂了。\n陆九的嘴——开了花。是红花。\n陆九的嘴说了第一句话"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 14,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我认你",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白无垢的两只裂开的眼——流出了白色的泪。白色的泪流到白花中心——白小妹的脸上。\n白小妹的脸——笑了。笑得极甜。\n白小妹的笑——是等到了陆九的\"我认你\"的笑。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 15,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "白无垢——我们——是一家人。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白小妹的笑——是儿子有了外祖的笑。\n陆九的嘴说了第二句话：\n\"白无垢——我们——是一家人。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 16,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "外祖。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白无垢的嘴——张了。\n白无垢的嘴——没说出来。\n白无垢的嘴抖了三息。\n三息之后——\n白无垢的嘴说了第一句话：\n\"外祖。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 17,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "白无垢——我——这辈子——第一次——认了。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "只有这两个字。\n是白无垢——这辈子——说的第一次自己的话。\n不是白小妹的话。不是老阁主的话。是白无垢——自己的话。\n是白无垢——这辈子——唯一一次——敢说的话。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 18,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的嘴——说完了。\n陆九的嘴——闭了。\n陆九的肚脐——凉了。\n绿疤——不开花了。\n陆九的肚脐——是陆九的肚脐。\n陆九——是陆九。\n陆九——是瞎眼先生。\n陆九—"
  }
]